   169	
   170	```python
   171	if self._m4_enabled:
   172	    if raw.get("injection_rung1", {}).get("enabled", False):
   173	        raise ValueError("capacity_penalty v1 must not stack with injection_rung1 (scope guard)")
   174	    if raw.get("catfish_faithful", {}).get("enabled", False):
